+
+    MEASURED ON THE BOX 2026-09-24/25, over the live 539,462-row docket and the 111,869-row
+    unrunnable bank: 192,757 rows (35.7%) keyed differently, and the bank's intersection with
+    this function's keys was ZERO against 78,771 with the judge's own. The build-failure bank
